  message: "P3 REVIEW 2026-11-01 (dev 100b6fbb6e; owner-requested re-check of open P3 items last modified before 2026-10-20; fixtures under ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/p3_review_11012026/gorc1/). VERDICT: CURRENT. 2026-11-01 review (dev 100b6fbb6e): cert-manager analyze_go counts identical to filing (cc=method resolved dst: function 306 all logs.WithResource, struct 11, field 158); alertmanager function 2, type 2. Narrowing: a bare untyped local (y:=get(); y.Helper()) is now guarded (external 0.4); binding shapes seen are pkg.Var.M() (corev1.SchemeGroupVersion.*), an external call result (tmpltext.New(\"\").Option -> repo Option type), and a package whose name differs from its import leaf (go-smtp: smtp.NewServer -> unrelated repo NewServer 0.85). MECHANISM: hint-less short-name lookup on a selector call accepts any symbol kind (function/struct/type/field). SHARES MECHANISM WITH: WI-jalal."  # 5130
