- op: discuss  # 9821
  at: '2026-11-03T03:34:58Z'  # 9821
  by: agent  # 9821
  actor: jgstern_agent  # 9821
  clock: 7  # 9821
  nonce: '9821'  # 9821
  message: "DONE in PR #2023 (merged; dev 22a17079b3). A call on a VALUE (x.F(), call_construct=method) whose receiver the analyzer cannot type reaches the shared resolver with an `admit` (go.py _go_value_member): a method, or a field whose declared type in field_type_registry starts with `func`; a package function, struct, named type or data field is refused and the call takes the existing unresolved-edge arm (go:external:0-0:F:unresolved, call_construct method). The same admit guards the same-file local_symbols hit. _extract_struct_field_types now records function-typed fields (it skipped every non-named type), which is what lets the 43-of-78 correct field calls WI-jalal counted survive. This is the #2006 Rust rule ported to Go, the WI-jomik call-shape adopter this item was listed as.\nA/B (pre-registered during the branch run; lab ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/surid_11022026/: PREREGISTER.md, RESULT.md, measure.py, diff_ab.py, classify_fields.py), base dev 39714a71ce vs the branch, resolved ast_call/method edges per site: cert-manager lost function 306 + struct 11 + field 4 (base 2532 method / 306 / 158 / 11), alertmanager lost field 33 + type 2 + function 2 (kept 45 of 78 fields; WI-jalal's review: 43 correct), coredns lost field 3, prometheus lost field 5 + function 6. Lost methods 0; gained 0. Every lost field was read by its declaration: int x32, []byte x3, []string x3, uint16 x3, bool x2, string, and ONE named function type (prometheus PostingsDecoder: a correct edge lost, filed as WI-sudol). The 306 are all `<group>.SchemeGroupVersion.WithResource(...)` -> pkg/logs.WithResource, the filed shape. All 37 alertmanager lost sites re-appear as unresolved calls at the same (src, line).\nProduction-path tests: packages/hypergumbo-lang-mainstream/tests/test_go_value_receiver_admit.py (function, struct, type and data-field hits refused and left unresolved; func-typed field, method and package-qualified function still bind; a stdlib call-result receiver is external before any lookup). Mutations: admit off -> exactly the four refused cases red (each reaches the arm); function_type branch off -> exactly the func-field control red. Seen, not this arm, filed as WI-zijab: the TYPED-receiver arms return a data field as the callee (prometheus s.T() -> Sample.T int64 x8; alertmanager route.Match -> config.Route.Match map x2). WI-jalal's fold: its 35 non-function field binds on alertmanager are the 33 lost here (+2 the typed arm still binds, WI-zijab)."  # 9821
